span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-eZKLwX jcZVJU pf-21_">I am Doug Ryan.  I run the outdoor activity and gear review website EndlessRushOutdoors.com. I am an avid skier, paddleboarder and sailor from Michigan.  We ski Michigan and travel out west several times a winter. We hope to ski Japan and Europe in the next few winters. We understand that good gear can make it break your experience skiing and doing other outdoor sports.  We also run a skiing and outdoor activity meetup in Michigan where we organize ski trips and constantly get asked for gear advice.</span></p><i class="sc-Galmp bSmgIP pf-22_ pfa-brands pfa-instagram" data-href="https://www.instagram.com/endlessrushoutdoors/" data-target="_self" data-pf-type="Icon"></i><i class="sc-Galmp bSmgIP pf-23_ pfa-brands pfa-facebook" data-href="https://www.facebook.com/endlessrushoutdoors" data-target="_self" data-pf-type="Icon"></i><i class="sc-Galmp bSmgIP pf-24_ pfa-brands pfa-youtube" data-href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCiS3BhrXlqk9Ap7OahT7eEg" data-target="_self" data-pf-type="Icon"></i><i class="sc-Galmp bSmgIP pf-25_ pfa-brands pfa-twitter" data-href="https://twitter.com/endlessrushodrs" data-target="_self" data-pf-type="Icon"></i></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-968f" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-eSxRXt eFcmyr pf-26_"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-jNHqnW kAyuLL"><div class="sc-cTAqQK cFxQA-d pf-27_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fvpsdx eVTiRY pf-28_"><div class="sc-crHmcD fJKcYb pf-29_ pf-custom pf-icon-left" data-scrolling="false" data-multiple="false" data-pf-type="Accordion"><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-egiyK kKHsVi pf-30_"><button type="button" class="sc-kDTinF iZLlzd pf-31_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="007fd57b-e93e-4e5b-8076-0b484103a2e6" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-caret-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Q1: Your recent Venustas heated apparel.</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="007fd57b-e93e-4e5b-8076-0b484103a2e6" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-iqseJM dvrCre pf-33_"><div class="sc-cTAqQK cFxQA-d pf-34_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fvpsdx eVTiRY pf-35_"><p class="sc-ljMRFG jiRhOP pf-36_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-eZKLwX jcZVJU pf-38_">A: We recently tried out Venustas heated vests to wear under our ski jackets on cold days. They help give you that extra bit of heat on cold lift rides.They also work great for outdoor hikes and walking on cold days.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-egiyK kKHsVi pf-39_"><button type="button" class="sc-kDTinF iZLlzd pf-40_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="e93e8e5b-8076-4b48-8103-a2e69913b5a9" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-caret-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Q2: How does Venustas heated apparel change your lifestyle?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="e93e8e5b-8076-4b48-8103-a2e69913b5a9" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-iqseJM dvrCre pf-42_"><div class="sc-cTAqQK cFxQA-d pf-43_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fvpsdx eVTiRY pf-44_"><p class="sc-ljMRFG jiRhOP pf-45_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-eZKLwX jcZVJU pf-47_">A: Venustas heated clothing let’s us stay warmer outdoors longer without excessive extra layers.  A heated layer allows you to go with less insulation so your overall outfit is lighter and thinner. It lets people who naturally feel cold stay out in the snow longer and more comfortably.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-egiyK kKHsVi pf-48_"><button type="button" class="sc-kDTinF iZLlzd pf-49_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="80760b48-4103-42e6-9913-b5a9bc3a1657" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-caret-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Q3: Which part most appealing to you about Venustas?</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="80760b48-4103-42e6-9913-b5a9bc3a1657" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-iqseJM dvrCre pf-51_"><div class="sc-cTAqQK cFxQA-d pf-52_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fvpsdx eVTiRY pf-53_"><p class="sc-ljMRFG jiRhOP pf-54_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-eZKLwX jcZVJU pf-56_">A: Venustas makes a variety of affordable heated clothing at very reasonable prices. They have a lot of options so you can hear your baselayers or heat your outerwear. They give you lots of flexibility to heat your body areas where you usually feel cold the most.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div><div data-pf-type="Accordion.Content.Wrapper" class="sc-egiyK kKHsVi pf-57_"><button type="button" class="sc-kDTinF iZLlzd pf-58_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor" data-header-id="c895a34c-7b42-4352-b481-b9358f32149f" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion.Header"><i class="pfa pfa-caret-right pfa-arrow"></i><span>Q4: The reason to be our V+ Master.</span></button><div data-pf-expandable="true" data-id="c895a34c-7b42-4352-b481-b9358f32149f" style="display:none" data-pf-type="Accordion.Content" class="sc-iqseJM dvrCre pf-60_"><div class="sc-cTAqQK cFxQA-d pf-61_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fvpsdx eVTiRY pf-62_"><p class="sc-ljMRFG jiRhOP pf-63_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-eZKLwX jcZVJU pf-65_">A: I like the Venustas items I have tried so far. I think they are a high value item at a good price point that many skiers would appreciate if they knew about the company. I like promoting gear that works that most skiers can find affordable. Michigan skiers for the most part are local and not high budget.</span></p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-section-id="pf-4399" data-pf-type="Section" class="sc-eSxRXt eFcmyr pf-69_"><div style="--cw:1170px" class="sc-jNHqnW kAyuLL"><div class="sc-cTAqQK cFxQA-d pf-70_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fvpsdx eVTiRY pf-71_"><p class="sc-ljMRFG jiRhOP pf-72_" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-eZKLwX jcZVJU pf-74_">Gallery</span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-cTAqQK cFxQA-d pf-75_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fvpsdx eVTiRY pf-76_"><div data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-jIkXHa iLIdP pf-77_"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0457/1099/9709/t/4/assets/img_1046-1652842084241_1200x.jpg?v=1652842085" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0457/1099/9709/t/4/assets/img_1046-1652842084241.jpg?v=1652842085 1536w" width="2016" height="1512" sizes="(min-width: 1536px) 1536px, (min-width: 1024px) 1280px, (min-width: 640px) 768px, 320px" loading="lazy"/></div></div></div></div><div class="sc-cTAqQK cFxQA-d pf-78_ pf-r pf-r-eh pf-lg-hide pf-md-hide pf-sm-hide pf-hide" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:3;--c-lg:3"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-fvpsdx eVTiRY pf-79_"><div data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-jIkXHa iLIdP pf-80_"><img src="https://cdn.pagefly.io/static/images/placeholder/img-placeholder-illustration.svg" loading